      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَتَّى</span></b> , originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَتَّتَ</span>, which has not been
heard, (like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَظَنَّى</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَظَنَّنَ</span>, TA,) i. q. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَطَّى</span>.
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَتَّى فِى الحَبْلِ</span> <i>He bore upon the rope
in order to break it,</i> (K,) or <i>to stretch it out.</i>
(TA.) See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">متو</span>.

